  "known_behavior_summary": [
    "Local Sound Bar starts at engage, marks a player Noisy at max alternate power, and drives Devastation only while a Noisy player exists.",
    "A ground gong manually interrupts Atramedes and applies Vertigo; an air gong redirects Reverberating Flame to the shield and then the gong user.",
    "Local timing is first Modulation13s, Sonar14.5s, Sonic24s, Searing46s, liftoff91s; after landing, ground events restart with Sonar14s, Modulation13s, Searing51s, Sonic22s, liftoff93s.",
    "Local Heroic Nefarius starts Fiends at30s, repeats35s, stops at liftoff, and restarts30s after landing; the Fiend chooses a random eligible player within100yd and casts Obnoxious after attachment.",
    "Instance mapping is DATA_ATRAMEDES=3; FAIL schedules shield/boss respawn after30s and DONE despawns shields and notifies generic Nefarius.",
    "4.4.2 client and 4.3.4 DBC agree on every encounter spell value; normal Modulation adds no Sound, heroic adds 10.",
    "Sound sources (10N): Sonar Pulse disks +3 per 0.5 s within 5 yd; Sonic Breath +20 per 1 s tick in a 15-degree beam; fire patches +5 (3 yd); air breath +3 per 0.5 s (5 yd); spawned air patches +10 (8 yd); Sonar Bomb +20 (6 yd). A shield strike sets everyone to 0.",
    "Native fixes (2026-09-25): Sound Bar and Noisy! removed on evade/death; intro-flight Vertigo resumes the landing; landing removes the air Sonar Bomb trigger; redirected Reverberating Flame restarts at initial speed; time-to-Searing-Flame/Sonic-Breath/liftoff published through GetTimeUntilEncounterMechanic.",
    "Devastation (78868) has no DB target restriction; a staged condition limits it to Noisy! holders per both current guides."
